note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Files, 738.00/7–1059. Confidential;
                    Priority. Drafted by Little; cleared in draft with Rubottom and John C. Dreier,
                    Acting Director of the Office of Inter-American Regional Political Affairs;
                    cleared in substance with Captain R. Kefauver, Head of the Western Hemisphere
                    Branch of the Office of the Chief of Naval Operations; and signed by Wieland.
                    Donhauser was also informed of the telegram’s substance.
